//   MODE bits[1:0] are kept 0 throughout to satisfy stvec_mode 'direct' bin.
//   Walking 1s use CSRS (CSRRS) — csrrc/walking 0s not needed per CTP.
//   stvec is cleared via CSRW zero before each CSRS so the OR result is
//   exactly the walking-1 pattern.
/////////////////////////////////
